# sndbnk

A SoundCloud-style audio host. Creators upload tracks; every creator gets a public profile reachable
by path, by subdomain, or on their own custom domain. SvelteKit + Svelte 5 runes, plain JS with
JSDoc, Drizzle over SQLite, better-auth, running on Bun.

## Hard constraints

Violating any of these breaks the app.

- **Bun, not Node.** `src/lib/server/db/index.js` imports `bun:sqlite`. Every command goes through
  Bun (`bun run dev`, `bun run build`, `bun x …`).
- **`#lib/...`, never `$lib`.** It is a package `imports` map in `package.json`; the `$lib` alias was
  removed from this project.
- **`safeRedirect()` from `#lib/server/safe-redirect`, never `redirect()` from `@sveltejs/kit`** in
  server code. Kit's version crashes under `svelte-adapter-bun`.
- **Plain JS with JSDoc types.** `jsconfig.json` sets `checkJs: false`. Do not add `.ts` files, do
  not add a type-check step, do not convert JSDoc to TS syntax.
- **Env through `$app/env/private` / `$app/env/public`**, declared in `src/env.js`. `process.env`
  only in build config and standalone scripts.

## Where things live

| Area                         | Path                                                             |
| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Hooks (tenant + auth)        | `src/hooks.server.js`                                            |
| Routes, loads, actions, API  | `src/routes/**`                                                  |
| Server services              | `src/lib/server/**`                                              |
| Schema                       | `src/lib/server/db/schema.js` (+ generated `auth.schema.js`)     |
| Components                   | `src/lib/components/**`                                          |
| Tenant site publishing       | `src/lib/server/site-page-public.js` + `src/routes/[...path]`    |
| Site builder and blocks      | `src/routes/sites/[id]/builder` + `src/lib/components/blocks/**` |
| Global player state          | `src/lib/player/player.svelte.js`                                |
| Design tokens and global CSS | `src/routes/layout.css`                                          |
| Schema migrations            | `drizzle/` + `scripts/migrate-sqlite.js`                         |

Routes call `src/lib/server/*` services; services own `db`. Routes never query `db` directly, and
components never import from `src/lib/server/`.

